  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to 1 Samuel 17:49-50, what did David use to defeat Goliath?', '1 Samuel 17:49-50', 'David put his hand in his bag, took a stone and slung it, and struck the Philistine in his forehead. The stone sank into his forehead, and he fell on his face to the earth. So David prevailed over the Philistine with a sling and with a stone, and struck the Philistine and killed him; but there was no sword in David''s hand.', 'WEB', 3,
