  ((select id from w), 'sequence', 'Given these three quotations, place them in the order they occur in the text.', '2 Samuel 5:1; 7:16; 12:7', 'Then all the tribes of Israel came to David at Hebron and spoke, saying, ''Behold, we are your bone and your flesh.''; Your house and your kingdom will be made sure forever before you. Your throne will be established forever.; Nathan said to David, ''You are the man! This is what Yahweh, the God of Israel, says: I anointed you king over Israel, and I delivered you out of the hand of Saul.''', 'WEB', 4,
