  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what did David cry out as he wept over Absalom''s death?', '2 Samuel 18:33', 'The king was much moved, and went up to the room over the gate and wept. As he went, he said, ''My son Absalom! My son, my son Absalom! I wish I had died instead of you, Absalom, my son, my son!''', 'WEB', 3,
